<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 5,960 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 115.89 pence a kilo against 115.65 last week and 112.95 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 259,512 pkgs sold so far this year is 113.11 pence against 102.24 pence for the 370,247 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
